      "cooked": "<p>Hy,</p>\n<p>I have performed a payment entry against invoice and some amount is deducted in form of Bank Charges, Bank Clearance does not fetch entry to clear date. Thus BRS is not being tally/performed. I am using V15.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/7/d704a4102b82af9b876a32c45284e279f675ad42.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d704a4102b82af9b876a32c45284e279f675ad42\" title=\"101\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d704a4102b82af9b876a32c45284e279f675ad42_2_690x398.png\" alt=\"101\" data-base62-sha1=\"uG8B9cBiFPv8cJzuyJdU2VfFgVI\" width=\"690\" height=\"398\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d704a4102b82af9b876a32c45284e279f675ad42_2_690x398.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d704a4102b82af9b876a32c45284e279f675ad42_2_1035x597.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d704a4102b82af9b876a32c45284e279f675ad42_2_1380x796.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">101</span><span class=\"informations\">1596×922 67.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/2/e26ceb8196fcffda5960cd643fdd1045478fffc3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e26ceb8196fcffda5960cd643fdd1045478fffc3\" title=\"102\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/2/e26ceb8196fcffda5960cd643fdd1045478fffc3_2_690x246.png\" alt=\"102\" data-base62-sha1=\"wj3gD4G7YsWwMyylGZ825LYSBMv\" width=\"690\" heig