      "id": 438010,
      "username": "peterg",
      "name": "Peter",
      "created_at": "2024-09-28T10:16:27.908Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Your workflow is a bit different than mine. I’ve never used Bank Clearance (thought that was just for changing the dates, but I could definitely be wrong about that).</p>\n<p>When reconciling Bank Transactions and Payments, I’ve always used the Bank Reconciliation Tool. Does that give you better results?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/peterg/{size}/55463_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
