    {
      "id": 438017,
      "username": "Smit-Bhaliya",
      "name": "Smit",
      "created_at": "2024-09-28T11:10:34.651Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/peterg\">@peterg</a></p>\n<p>Bank Clearance is used to update the clearance date for bank transactions, while the Bank Reconciliation Tool is more efficient for reconciling bank transactions with payments. If you’re already using the Bank Reconciliation Tool, it should give better results for matching transactions and payments accurately.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/smit-bhaliya/{size}/76657_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
