    {
      "id": 493638,
      "username": "volkswagner",
      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2026-02-07T01:35:31.638Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When using bank reconcilation tool, it can create bank entries when matching existing transactions or creating new. It seem sometimes this updates the clearance_date in Bank Clearance and sometimes it does not.</p>\n<p>Does anyone know the ryme or reason when it does vs when it does not.</p>\n<p>It seems to me, when Bank Clearance is not complete, the balance shown in Bank Reconcilation is not accurate.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/volkswagner/{size}/55461_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
      "Reads": 22,
      "wikis": null,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_view_edit_history": true,
