    {
      "id": 493677,
      "username": "volkswagner",
      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2026-02-07T13:36:06.096Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This happens with a 1:1 relation of payment entry to bank transaction. Sometimes when matching a bank transaction in Bank Reconciliation, it populates the clearance_date in Bank Clearance doctype and sometimes it does not. These are invoice payments that are paid in full with a single payment entry.</p>\n<p>I will have to pay closer attention to when or why. I was hoping someone else could confirm the behavior.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/volkswagner/{size}/55461_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
      "Reads": 17,
      "wikis": null,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_view_edit_history": true,
      "can_wiki": false,
